# infra/github inputs.
#
# terraform.tfvars IS COMMITTED in this stack (see .gitignore) and already carries the three
# deployer-role ARNs, because their absence plans a destroy. This example exists for the inputs that
# are NOT committed, and to document the full set.
#
#   github_token   REQUIRED, no default, never committed. `-var github_token=$(gh auth token)` —
#                  needs Administration (rulesets) + Contents + Actions variables write.
#   public_app_url has a default; override only when the public origin moves.
#
# Everything else (github_owner, repository, integration_branch, rc_branch,
# required_status_checks) has a correct non-empty default. See variables.tf.

# public_app_url = "https://alethialabs.io"
